{"1939280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aeon Wars Rogue", "steam_appid": 1939280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.poster.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.webm?t=1773851291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.mp4?t=1773851291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aeon Wars Rogue is a turn-based strategy, tactical roguelite wargame. Featuring true digital miniatures, it is set in an original sci-fi universe where you battle in epic diorama-style terrains. Collect, build, and customize your army. Engage in large-scale battles and deadly skirmishes to further test your  army's limits. Unlock and deploy powerful mechs, special units, and unique characters to save humanity  on Leng. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/5edf763d4f9e49393e62fd77e389ee1b.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINIATURES BROUGHT TO LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wargaming without real-world limits. Aeon Wars brings fully animated handcrafted miniatures, immersive maps with epic diorama-style terrains, and a frictionless hobby experience. Your miniatures have never looked this good! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/c20b31690dc3d8dbcfa225a1011cb02a.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR ARMY, YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squads to build the best army you can to combat ever-changing maps and scenarios. Start small, bring your troops to battle, make it out alive, tweak your loadouts, and improve your surviving army until you can save the world from your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/d236d4cc99704ee8ca5205acdcaf89a0.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP TACTICAL COMBAT, ARMY SIZED WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aeon Wars is all about tactical choices. Strategically position your troops on the battlefield, take advantage of cover, suppress your enemies, set up overwatch angles, run to capture critical objectives and use each of your unit's unique abilities to secure victory!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/e2a9adc5c035a7a3889e813e5644c893.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR COMMANDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a Commander to lead the resistance on Leng. Each one has its radically unique flavor and gameplay style. Choose your favorite or try them all to experience the wide variety of models and abilities available.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/48ba0fb701fe07aa919c560c0b41282e.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR THE FUTURE OF HUMANITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2350, and what will later be known as the 2nd Aeon War is raging on Leng, a colonized moon 14 light years away from Earth. Three major fronts collide: the human-centric Nesuv Empire, the greedy technocrats from Drustan, and the corrupted aeons from the Arkosys organization. You're thrown into this web of lies, fractured alliances, and rising horror. Forge your path and liberate Ashkalon from the Arkosys' influence.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.poster.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.webm?t=1773851291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.mp4?t=1773851291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aeon Wars Rogue is a turn-based strategy, tactical roguelite wargame. Featuring true digital miniatures, it is set in an original sci-fi universe where you battle in epic diorama-style terrains. Collect, build, and customize your army. Engage in large-scale battles and deadly skirmishes to further test your  army's limits. Unlock and deploy powerful mechs, special units, and unique characters to save humanity  on Leng. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/5edf763d4f9e49393e62fd77e389ee1b.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINIATURES BROUGHT TO LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wargaming without real-world limits. Aeon Wars brings fully animated handcrafted miniatures, immersive maps with epic diorama-style terrains, and a frictionless hobby experience. Your miniatures have never looked this good! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/c20b31690dc3d8dbcfa225a1011cb02a.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR ARMY, YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squads to build the best army you can to combat ever-changing maps and scenarios. Start small, bring your troops to battle, make it out alive, tweak your loadouts, and improve your surviving army until you can save the world from your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/d236d4cc99704ee8ca5205acdcaf89a0.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP TACTICAL COMBAT, ARMY SIZED WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aeon Wars is all about tactical choices. Strategically position your troops on the battlefield, take advantage of cover, suppress your enemies, set up overwatch angles, run to capture critical objectives and use each of your unit's unique abilities to secure victory!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/e2a9adc5c035a7a3889e813e5644c893.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR COMMANDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a Commander to lead the resistance on Leng. Each one has its radically unique flavor and gameplay style. Choose your favorite or try them all to experience the wide variety of models and abilities available.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/48ba0fb701fe07aa919c560c0b41282e.avif?t=1773851291\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR THE FUTURE OF HUMANITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2350, and what will later be known as the 2nd Aeon War is raging on Leng, a colonized moon 14 light years away from Earth. Three major fronts collide: the human-centric Nesuv Empire, the greedy technocrats from Drustan, and the corrupted aeons from the Arkosys organization. You're thrown into this web of lies, fractured alliances, and rising horror. Forge your path and liberate Ashkalon from the Arkosys' influence.</p>", "short_description": "Aeon Wars Rogue is a turn-based tactical roguelite wargame. Play through a planetary sized conflict to unlock new gear, weapons and squads. Lead the fight with commander units and build an army capable of fighting off the Arkosys for good.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/31674c30b0cd63a58c7100050d518628c76a467d/header.jpg?t=1773851291", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s